        "translate": "content_lock:dialogue.tutorial.page3.text1",
        "fallback": "Tools: \n\n All of the tools in Content Lock can break all of the blocks that given type of tool can mine from the very beggining, removing the need to upgrade them for mining purposes. All of them also share rougly the same dps, meaning that upgrades are mostly sidegrades, which give you different utility or stats rather than just more damage."
